{
  "$comment": [
    "UNVERIFIED: sender IDs below are expected values gathered from public parser projects and general knowledge.",
    "Only 'MPESA', 'AirtelMoney' and 'TKASH' were seen as the `address` of a message in public code; every other",
    "entry must be checked against a real SMS Backup & Restore export (run with --list-senders to see what your",
    "phone actually has) before a provider pack relies on it. Matching is case-insensitive on the whole sender",
    "string after whitespace normalisation. See docs/research/sms-formats.md for sources.",
    "`public_counterparties` are institution names that the redactor keeps verbatim when they appear as a",
    "counterparty (they are not personal data and they anchor message families such as bank-to-M-PESA).",
    "Everything else that follows an anchor like 'sent to' or 'paid to' is replaced with REDACTED PERSON /",
    "REDACTED MERCHANT."
  ],
